{"id":"665572","name":"日式冬瓜裙带鲜虾菌菇汤","author":"polaris滴食记","authorId":"10301589","desc":"","cover":"images/665572/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干裙带菜","amount":"20克"},{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"300克"},{"name":"杏鲍菇","amount":"2个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"熟鲜虾","amount":"6只"}],"sub":[{"name":"关东煮调味汁","amount":"1包"},{"name":"清水","amount":"800毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"康宁锅内倒入800毫升清水。","img":"images/665572/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入1包45克关东煮调味汁。","img":"images/665572/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入提前泡发好的裙带菜。","img":"images/665572/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入冬瓜块。","img":"images/665572/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入胡萝卜厚片。","img":"images/665572/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入杏鲍菇厚片。","img":"images/665572/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖上锅盖大火煮开后炖煮5分钟。","img":"images/665572/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入熟鲜虾。","img":"images/665572/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"继续炖煮5分钟即可关火出锅。","img":"images/665572/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665572/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}